---
title: "Experience | Parul Soni Manvati"
layout: layouts/base.njk
seoTitle: "Experience | Parul Soni Manvati"
seoDescription: "A career is more useful when you can see the problems behind the titles. Explore Parul Soni Manvati's experience by capability: strategy, transformation, technology, operations, capital and policy."
---
{% import "partials/experience-card.njk" as cards %}
{% import "partials/recommendation-card.njk" as recs %}
{% import "partials/media-placeholder.njk" as media %}

<section class="page-header">
  <div class="wrap">
    <span class="eyebrow">{{ experiencePage.eyebrow }}</span>
    <h1>{{ experiencePage.headline }}</h1>
    <p>{{ experiencePage.supportingStatement }}</p>
    {% if experiencePage.explanationParagraphs.length %}
    <div class="prose" style="margin-top: 1.5rem; max-width: 62ch; color: var(--muted);">
      {% for para in experiencePage.explanationParagraphs %}
      <p>{{ para }}</p>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
    {% endif %}
  </div>
</section>

{% set snapdealFlagship = "snapdeal-same-day-next-day" | experienceByRef(collections.experienceStories) %}
{% set snapdealMore = "snapdeal-supply-chain-recovery" | experienceByRef(collections.experienceStories) %}
{% set amazonFlagship = "amazon-ai-ml-transformation" | experienceByRef(collections.experienceStories) %}
{% set addverbFlagship = "addverb-enterprise-transformation" | experienceByRef(collections.experienceStories) %}
{% set addverbCeoOffice = "addverb-ceo-office-rhythm" | experienceByRef(collections.experienceStories) %}
{% set addverbSupply = "addverb-semiconductor-supply" | experienceByRef(collections.experienceStories) %}
{% set clearmeatBusiness = "clearmeat-business-model" | experienceByRef(collections.experienceStories) %}
{% set clearmeatRegulatory = "clearmeat-building-emerging-category" | experienceByRef(collections.experienceStories) %}
{% set clearmeatSales = "clearmeat-techno-commercial-sales" | experienceByRef(collections.experienceStories) %}
{% set clearmeatVendor = "clearmeat-vendor-operations-portal" | experienceByRef(collections.experienceStories) %}
{% set systemFlagship = "abwci-msme-service-engine" | experienceByRef(collections.experienceStories) %}
{% set systemMarket = "abwci-digital-market-access" | experienceByRef(collections.experienceStories) %}
{% set systemUnctad = "unctad-abwci-digital-capacity-building" | experienceByRef(collections.experienceStories) %}

<section class="tier-dominant">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="section-heading">
      <span class="section-label">The Journey</span>
      <h2>Increasing complexity, one connecting thread.</h2>
      <p>Each stage of this career took on a harder version of the same question: what does this organisation actually need to change?</p>
    </div>

    <div class="journey-line">

      <div class="journey-chapter journey-chapter--foundation">
        <span class="journey-chapter__eyebrow">Foundation · DHL Express &amp; ICICI Bank</span>
        <h3 class="journey-chapter__title">Learning the customer and commercial reality</h3>
        <div class="journey-chapter__body">
          <p>Early career at DHL Express and ICICI Bank built the fundamentals everything after it relies on: understanding the customer, commercial discipline, frontline execution, and learning how businesses actually operate day to day.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      {% if snapdealFlagship %}
      <div class="journey-chapter journey-chapter--snapdeal">
        <span class="journey-chapter__eyebrow">Snapdeal{% if snapdealFlagship.data.year_or_period %} · {{ snapdealFlagship.data.year_or_period }}{% endif %}</span>
        <h3 class="journey-chapter__title">Building speed and operational foundations</h3>
        <div class="journey-chapter__body">
          <p>{{ snapdealFlagship.data.summary }}</p>
          {% set snapImpact = snapdealFlagship.data.impact | publicImpact %}
          {% if snapImpact.length %}
          <div class="journey-metric">
            <span class="journey-metric-value">{{ snapImpact[0].value }}</span>
            <span class="journey-metric-label">{{ snapImpact[0].label }}</span>
          </div>
          {% endif %}
          <a class="btn btn--text" href="{{ snapdealFlagship.url }}">Explore the transformation →</a>
          {% if snapdealMore %}
          <p class="journey-waypoint" style="margin-top: 1.5rem;">Related: <a href="{{ snapdealMore.url }}"><strong>{{ snapdealMore.data.title }}</strong></a></p>
          {% endif %}
        </div>
      </div>
      {% endif %}

      {% if amazonFlagship %}
      <div class="journey-chapter journey-chapter--amazon">
        <span class="journey-chapter__eyebrow">Amazon{% if amazonFlagship.data.year_or_period %} · {{ amazonFlagship.data.year_or_period }}{% endif %}</span>
        <h3 class="journey-chapter__title">Operating at global scale and redesigning work with technology</h3>
        <div class="journey-chapter__body">
          <div class="split" style="align-items: start; gap: 2rem;">
            <div>
              <p>{{ amazonFlagship.data.summary }}</p>
              {% set amazonImpact = amazonFlagship.data.impact | publicImpact %}
              {% if amazonImpact.length %}
              <div class="journey-metric">
                <span class="journey-metric-value">{{ amazonImpact[0].value }}</span>
                <span class="journey-metric-label">{{ amazonImpact[0].label }}</span>
              </div>
              {% endif %}
              <a class="btn btn--text" href="{{ amazonFlagship.url }}">Explore the transformation →</a>
            </div>
            <div>{{ media.placeholder("Amazon operations, working session", "3/2") }}</div>
          </div>
          <p class="journey-waypoint" style="margin-top: 1.5rem;">Related:
            {% if amazonFlagship %}<a href="/experience/amazon-catalogue-compliance/"><strong>Catalogue Compliance</strong></a>,{% endif %}
            <a href="/experience/amazon-five-marketplace-launch/"><strong>Marketplace Launch</strong></a> and
            <a href="/experience/amazon-governance-scale/"><strong>Governance at Scale</strong></a>
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
      {% endif %}

      {% if addverbFlagship %}
      <div class="journey-chapter journey-chapter--addverb">
        <span class="journey-chapter__eyebrow">Addverb{% if addverbCeoOffice.data.year_or_period %} · {{ addverbCeoOffice.data.year_or_period }}{% endif %}</span>
        <h3 class="journey-chapter__title">Working beside leadership on enterprise transformation</h3>
        <div class="journey-chapter__body">
          <p>{{ addverbFlagship.data.summary }}</p>
          {% set addverbImpact = addverbFlagship.data.impact | publicImpact %}
          {% if addverbImpact.length %}
          <div class="journey-metric">
            <span class="journey-metric-value">{{ addverbImpact[0].value }}</span>
            <span class="journey-metric-label">{{ addverbImpact[0].label }}</span>
          </div>
          {% endif %}
          <a class="btn btn--text" href="{{ addverbFlagship.url }}">Explore the transformation →</a>
          <p class="journey-waypoint" style="margin-top: 1.5rem;">Related:
            {% if addverbCeoOffice %}<a href="{{ addverbCeoOffice.url }}"><strong>{{ addverbCeoOffice.data.title }}</strong></a>{% endif %}{% if addverbSupply %} and <a href="{{ addverbSupply.url }}"><strong>{{ addverbSupply.data.title }}</strong></a>{% endif %}
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
      {% endif %}

      <div class="journey-chapter journey-chapter--paytm">
        <span class="journey-chapter__eyebrow">Paytm</span>
        <h3 class="journey-chapter__title">Operating inside a large-scale digital ecosystem</h3>
        <div class="journey-chapter__body">
          <p>A chapter still being written up in detail. Watch this space, or ask directly in a conversation.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      {% if clearmeatBusiness %}
      <div class="journey-chapter journey-chapter--clearmeat">
        <span class="journey-chapter__eyebrow">ClearMeat</span>
        <h3 class="journey-chapter__title">I chose to step into the unknown.</h3>
        <div class="journey-chapter__body">
          <p>After years operating inside established organisations and large systems, I deliberately stepped into an emerging industry where many of the structures a business normally relies on were still being created. This chapter is not a pivot into a narrow specialism. It is a bet on operating range: learning across emerging technology, business-model adaptation, commercialisation, capital discipline, government and regulation, and ecosystem development, with fewer established structures to lean on than at any previous stage.</p>
          <p>{{ clearmeatBusiness.data.summary }}</p>
          {% set clearmeatImpact = clearmeatBusiness.data.impact | publicImpact %}
          {% if clearmeatImpact.length %}
          <div class="journey-metric">
            <span class="journey-metric-value">{{ clearmeatImpact[0].value }}</span>
            <span class="journey-metric-label">{{ clearmeatImpact[0].label }}</span>
          </div>
          {% endif %}
          <a class="btn btn--text" href="{{ clearmeatBusiness.url }}">Explore the transformation →</a>
          {% if clearmeatRegulatory %}
          <p style="margin-top: 1.5rem; color: var(--muted);">{{ clearmeatRegulatory.data.summary }}</p>
          <a class="btn btn--text" href="{{ clearmeatRegulatory.url }}">Explore the regulatory ecosystem story →</a>
          {% endif %}
          <p class="journey-waypoint" style="margin-top: 1.5rem;">Related:
            {% if clearmeatSales %}<a href="{{ clearmeatSales.url }}"><strong>{{ clearmeatSales.data.title }}</strong></a>{% endif %}{% if clearmeatVendor %} and <a href="{{ clearmeatVendor.url }}"><strong>{{ clearmeatVendor.data.title }}</strong></a>{% endif %}
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
      {% endif %}

      {% if systemFlagship %}
      <div class="journey-chapter journey-chapter--system">
        <span class="journey-chapter__eyebrow">System &amp; Ecosystem Work</span>
        <h3 class="journey-chapter__title">Applying operating experience to broader institutional and policy problems</h3>
        <div class="journey-chapter__body">
          <p>{{ systemFlagship.data.summary }}</p>
          <a class="btn btn--text" href="{{ systemFlagship.url }}">Explore the transformation →</a>
          <p class="journey-waypoint" style="margin-top: 1.5rem;">Related:
            {% if systemMarket %}<a href="{{ systemMarket.url }}"><strong>{{ systemMarket.data.title }}</strong></a>{% endif %}{% if systemUnctad %} and <a href="{{ systemUnctad.url }}"><strong>{{ systemUnctad.data.title }}</strong></a>{% endif %}
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
      {% endif %}

    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="tier-dominant teaser">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="section-heading" style="margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; text-align: center;">
      <span class="section-label" style="text-align: center; display: block;">What I Carry Forward</span>
      <h2>Threads that connect every chapter</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="convergence-threads">
      <p class="convergence-thread">Large-scale operating discipline, from running global operations at Amazon scale.</p>
      <p class="convergence-thread">CEO-level transformation thinking, from working directly inside the CEO Office at Addverb.</p>
      <p class="convergence-thread">Commercial and customer understanding, built from the ground up at DHL and ICICI.</p>
      <p class="convergence-thread">Zero-to-one resilience and capital discipline, forged by building ClearMeat's commercial engine from nothing.</p>
      <p class="convergence-thread">An AI and technology operating-model perspective, from redesigning how machine learning changes real work.</p>
      <p class="convergence-thread">Policy and ecosystem thinking, from building market and regulatory infrastructure where none existed.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="convergence-path" aria-label="Figure Out, Design, Build, Scale, Transform">
      <span>Figure Out</span><span>Design</span><span>Build</span><span>Scale</span><span>Transform</span>
    </div>
    <p style="text-align: center; max-width: 56ch; margin: 0 auto 2rem; color: var(--muted); font-size: 1.05rem;">The next chapter is about applying these lessons to problems where the scale, complexity and consequence are even greater.</p>
    <div class="teaser__ctas" style="justify-content: center;">
      <a class="btn btn--primary" href="/contact/">Start a Conversation →</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

{% if collections.activeBroadFilters.length %}
<section class="capability-filter-section" style="padding-top: clamp(2rem, 4vw, 3rem);">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="section-heading">
      <span class="section-label">Explore</span>
      <h2>Every problem, by theme</h2>
    </div>
    <span class="capability-filter__intro-label">Filter by capability</span>
    <div class="capability-filter" data-filter-bar>
      <button type="button" class="is-active" data-filter="all">All</button>
      {% for bf in collections.activeBroadFilters %}
      <button type="button" data-filter="{{ bf.slug }}">{{ bf.label }}</button>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
    <p class="filter-empty-state" hidden>No stories match this filter yet. <a href="/experience/" data-filter-reset>View all →</a></p>
  </div>
</section>
{% endif %}

{% set flagshipStories = collections.experienceStories | featured %}
{% if flagshipStories.length %}
<section class="experience-teaser tier-secondary">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="flagship-grid">
      {% for story in flagshipStories %}
        {{ cards.storyCard(story, collections.capabilityList, "large" if loop.first else "regular") }}
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
{% endif %}

{% set layer2Stories = collections.experienceStories | notFeatured %}
{% set layer2Initial = layer2Stories | limit(6) %}
{% set layer2Extra = layer2Stories | sliceArr(6, layer2Stories.length) %}
{% if layer2Stories.length %}
<section class="tier-secondary">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="card-grid">
      {% for story in layer2Initial %}
        {{ cards.storyCard(story, collections.capabilityList) }}
      {% endfor %}
    </div>

    {% if layer2Extra.length %}
    <details class="disclosure" id="more-stories-disclosure">
      <summary class="disclosure__summary">
        <span class="disclosure__label-more">View more problems I've worked on ↓</span>
        <span class="disclosure__label-fewer">Show fewer ↑</span>
      </summary>
      <div class="card-grid" style="margin-top: 1.75rem;">
        {% for story in layer2Extra %}
          {{ cards.storyCard(story, collections.capabilityList) }}
        {% endfor %}
      </div>
    </details>
    {% endif %}
  </div>
</section>
{% endif %}

{% set recsInitial = collections.recommendations | limit(4) %}
{% set recsExtra = collections.recommendations | sliceArr(4, collections.recommendations.length) %}
{% if collections.recommendations.length %}
<section class="teaser tier-secondary">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="section-heading">
      <span class="section-label">Recommendations</span>
      <h2>What people I've worked with say</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="recommendation-grid">
      {% for rec in recsInitial %}
        {{ recs.quote(rec) }}
      {% endfor %}
    </div>

    {% if recsExtra.length %}
    <details class="disclosure">
      <summary class="disclosure__summary">
        <span class="disclosure__label-more">Read more from people I've worked with ↓</span>
        <span class="disclosure__label-fewer">Show fewer ↑</span>
      </summary>
      <div class="recommendation-grid" style="margin-top: 1.75rem;">
        {% for rec in recsExtra %}
          {{ recs.quote(rec) }}
        {% endfor %}
      </div>
    </details>
    {% endif %}
  </div>
</section>
{% endif %}

<section class="tier-supporting">
  <div class="wrap">
    {% include "partials/linkedin-cta.njk" %}
  </div>
</section>
